WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Lascia ch'io pianga
Let me weep over

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.000
mia cruda sorte,
my cruel fate,

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.500
e che sospiri
and let me sigh

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:25.000
la libertà.
for liberty.

